  "description": {
    "raw": "The target experiences feelings of ennui and lethargy, becoming fatigued for the spell’s duration. While the target is fatigued and is within the spell’s range, you gain a +2 enhancement bonus to Strength and Dexterity. On a successful save, the target is fatigued for only 1d4 rounds and you receive no bonus. This spell has no effect if it targets a creature that is already fatigued.",
    "search_text": "\"the target experiences feelings of ennui and lethargy, becoming fatigued for the spell’s duration. while the target is fatigued and is within the spell’s range, you gain a +2 enhancement bonus to strength and dexterity. on a successful save, the target is fatigued for only 1d4 rounds and you receive no bonus. this spell has no effect if it targets a creature that is already fatigued.\"",
